  actually do self-custody and why are  these technologies so important in the  world it's awesome to see a mayor now  talking about this not only just taking  paychecks in bitcoin but also talking  about educating people about going to  the school system where every single kid  is required to be for a portion of the  day and saying to them let us teach you  actually valuable information  information that you'll be able to use  in your career and information that can  change your life as you go out into the  workforce kudos to the mayor of new york  i hope that more and more people around  the country start to actually take this  idea and run with it every single child  in america should be taught about these  technologies because these technologies  are the technologies that the future  will be built on
 

